WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 2-05 - Emerald City (The Trigger)
NOTE Artist: The Arctic Symphony Project
NOTE Album: 2007: Tales from the Solstice

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Looking through the rain-streaked glass

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Waiting for the gray to pass

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
They say there's a place where the colors shine

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Somewhere past the border line

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
A quiet dream above the rain

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
To wash away the miles of pain

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
But the sky turns black and the tires whine

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Welcome to the end of the line

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The neon burns and the skyline bleeds!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Trapped inside the emerald greed!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.000
The sepia fades to a blinding light!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Swallowed by the city tonight!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.000
There is no magic at the end of the road!

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Just a heavy, crushing load!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.000
I watched the gray world disappear

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.000
But there is only terror here

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.000
The towering glass and the glowing green

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Waking up inside the machine

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:32.000
The walls are high and the gates are locked

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.000
With every single hour mocked

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:08.000
I can't go back, the bridge is burned!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:14.000
Every single lesson learned!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.000
The vibrant colors suffocate!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Driven by a silent fate!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:54.000
I just want to go home

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:03.000
I just want to go home

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:12.000
The emerald light is blinding me

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:26.000
I just want to go home

